    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Tesla returns twelve weeks after starting sertraline and six weeks after the increase to 100 mg. At the nurse telephone check two weeks after the increase he reported two days of loose stools and no other side effects, and he has missed no doses. He has had eleven ERP sessions. He washes about 12 times a day, shook hands with an investor last week, and eats most meals without calculating. Counting steps and repeating actions in threes still take about an hour a day. His hands have healed. He sleeps about five and a half hours. He has had no suicidal thoughts. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Interval change</td><td>Washing about 12 times a day; shook hands with an investor; most meals without calculating</td></tr><tr><td>Psychotherapy</td><td>Eleven ERP sessions</td></tr><tr><td>Rituals</td><td>About an hour a day of counting and repeating</td></tr><tr><td>Hands</td><td>Healed</td></tr><tr><td>Safety</td><td>No suicidal thoughts</td></tr><tr><td>Y-BOCS</td><td>19, down from 28</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

